#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:2
msgid "Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "基于采样的量子对角化（SQD）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:4
msgid ""
"SQD samples a CCSD-seeded LUCJ state with ffsim. It solves the recovered subspace with qiskit-"
"addon-sqd. Both public entry points return an ``SQDResult`` with comparisons for the same "
"Hamiltonian. This classical simulation does not demonstrate quantum advantage or hardware "
"execution."
msgstr ""
"SQD 使用 ffsim 采样以 CCSD 为种子的 LUCJ 态。它用 qiskit-addon-sqd 求解恢复的子空间。两个公开入口均返回 "
"``SQDResult``，其中各项对比使用同一哈密顿量。这种经典模拟不证明量子优势或硬件执行。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:10
msgid "Installation and platform"
msgstr "安装与平台"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:12
msgid "Use this source checkout on Linux x86_64 for the SQD implementation and examples:"
msgstr "在 Linux x86_64 上使用此源码仓库运行 SQD 实现和示例："

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:20
msgid ""
"The public supervisor requires Linux x86_64 because it uses ``/proc`` and ``multiprocessing`` "
"with ``fork``. The supervisor rejects other platforms before execution."
msgstr "公开监督执行器使用 ``/proc`` 及带 ``fork`` 的 ``multiprocessing``，因此要求 Linux x86_64。它会在执行前拒绝其他平台。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:24
msgid ""
"The ``sqd`` extra installs ffsim and qiskit-addon-sqd. Catalyst is optional. Use ``uv.lock`` to "
"reproduce the dependency versions."
msgstr "``sqd`` extra 安装 ffsim 和 qiskit-addon-sqd。Catalyst 为可选项。使用 ``uv.lock`` 复现依赖版本。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:27
msgid ""
"``src/q2m3/sqd/resource_calibration.json`` defines the measured resource model and dependency "
"versions. The model does not cover other platforms or arbitrary dependency versions. Installed "
"Catalyst must match the calibration version. Catalyst may be absent."
msgstr ""
"``src/q2m3/sqd/resource_calibration.json`` 定义实测资源模型和依赖版本。模型不覆盖其他平台或任意依赖版本。若安装 "
"Catalyst，其版本必须匹配校准版本。也可以不安装 Catalyst。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:31
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`/tutorials/sqd-showcase` for a sequence of example runs. See :doc:`/api-reference/sqd` "
"for signatures and configuration types."
msgstr "按 :doc:`/tutorials/sqd-showcase` 依次运行示例。函数签名和配置类型见 :doc:`/api-reference/sqd`。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:34
msgid ""
"Ordinary ``import q2m3`` still imports PennyLane. The SQD algorithm does not call PennyLane or "
"Catalyst. SQD workflow exports load on access. Without the extra, they raise ``ImportError`` with"
" the installation command. To check availability, test ``\"run_sqd\" in q2m3.__all__``. Do not "
"use ``hasattr``, because it can trigger that error. Configuration/result types do not import "
"ffsim or Qiskit."
msgstr ""
"普通 ``import q2m3`` 仍导入 PennyLane。SQD 算法不调用 PennyLane 或 Catalyst。SQD "
"工作流导出在访问时加载。缺少可选依赖时，它们抛出带安装命令的 ``ImportError``。检查可用性时，测试 ``\"run_sqd\" in q2m3.__all__``。不要使用 "
"``hasattr``，因为它可能触发该错误。配置和结果类型不导入 ffsim 或 Qiskit。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:42
msgid "Two runnable public entry points"
msgstr "两个可运行的公开入口"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:44
msgid ""
"Save either Python block as a file. After the installation above, run ``uv run --no-sync python "
"FILE.py``. Both use H₂ at 0.74 Å/STO-3G, explicitly ``(2 electrons, 2 spatial orbitals)``, or "
"four system qubits. The small 128-shot smoke case uses seed 31 and two LUCJ repetitions. It "
"reaches the full four-determinant space. Agreement with CASCI is a regression check, not evidence"
" that sampling outperforms classical solvers."
msgstr ""
"将任一 Python 代码块保存为文件。完成上述安装后，运行 ``uv run --no-sync python FILE.py``。两者均使用 0.74 Å/STO-3G 的 H₂，并显式指定"
" ``(2 electrons, 2 spatial orbitals)``，对应四个系统量子比特。小规模 128 次采样冒烟案例使用种子 31 和两次 LUCJ "
"重复，达到完整的四行列式空间。与 CASCI 一致属于回归检查，不能证明采样优于经典求解器。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:51
msgid "The geometry entry point builds integrals and a same-frame CCSD seed:"
msgstr "几何入口构建积分及同轨道框架的 CCSD 种子："

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:74
msgid ""
"The integral entry point accepts already assembled chemist-order tensors. This example uses the "
"guarded producers to supply authenticated frame and CCSD data. ``host_available_mb`` is a "
"conservative memory cap, not a request to allocate that much memory. Here, currently available "
"Linux memory bounds it."
msgstr ""
"积分入口接受已组装的 chemist 顺序张量。本示例使用具有资源保护的生成函数，提供经过认证的轨道框架和 CCSD 数据。``host_available_mb`` "
"是保守内存上限，不是要求分配等量内存。此处以当前 Linux 可用内存限制它。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:113
msgid ""
"Both examples yield approximately −1.13728383449 Ha in the measured profile. "
"``run_sqd_from_integrals`` requires ``context``. Bare ``t1``/``t2`` arrays are not an accepted "
"substitute for ``CCSDSeed``. The solver checks these inputs:"
msgstr ""
"在实测配置中，两个示例均得到约 −1.13728383449 Ha。``run_sqd_from_integrals`` 要求传入 ``context``。裸 ``t1``/``t2`` "
"数组不能替代 ``CCSDSeed``。求解器检查以下输入："

