msgid "shape"
msgstr "形状"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:118
msgid "finite values"
msgstr "有限数值"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:119
msgid "balanced electron counts"
msgstr "平衡电子数"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:120
msgid "Hamiltonian/frame identity"
msgstr "哈密顿量 / 轨道框架标识"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:121
msgid "HF/CCSD energy"
msgstr "HF/CCSD 能量"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:122
msgid "CCSD residuals"
msgstr "CCSD 残差"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:124
msgid ""
"Failed or unconverged seeds raise an error. For a deliberate baseline-only run, set "
"``mode=\"reference_only\"`` (and ``seed_data=None`` at the integral entry). The workflow never "
"silently substitutes HF for a failed SQD run."
msgstr ""
"种子失败或未收敛时抛出错误。有意仅运行基准时，设置 ``mode=\"reference_only\"``，并在积分入口设置 ``seed_data=None``。工作流绝不会静默用 HF "
"替代失败的 SQD 运行。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:129
msgid "Fixed orbital frame and MM embedding"
msgstr "固定轨道框架与 MM 嵌入"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:131
msgid ""
"Coordinates, including ``mm_coords``, are in Å. ``mm_charges`` are in elementary charges. "
"Energies and integral constants are Hartree. The high-level entry accepts both MM arrays and "
"``embedding_mode=\"diagonal\"`` (default) or ``\"full_oneelectron\"``. The latter requires MM "
"charges. The vacuum MO frame and two-electron tensor stay fixed. Diagonal mode adds only diagonal"
" active one-electron terms. Full mode also retains off-diagonal terms."
msgstr ""
"坐标包括 ``mm_coords``，单位为 Å。``mm_charges`` 单位为元电荷。能量和积分常数单位为 Hartree。高层入口接受两组 MM 数组，以及 "
"``embedding_mode=\"diagonal\"``（默认）或 ``\"full_oneelectron\"``。后者要求 MM "
"电荷。真空分子轨道框架和双电子张量保持不变。对角模式仅添加活性空间对角单电子项，完整模式还保留非对角项。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:138
msgid ""
"All solver arms share the same active span, Hamiltonian, frame and core constant. ``e_core`` "
"already includes the MM nuclear contribution: do not add it again at the low-level entry. The "
"low-level ``h2`` is chemist ordered and is not transposed again. In an embedded fixed frame, "
"``hf_energy`` is the reference determinant expectation, not a relaxed embedded SCF minimum. Tests"
" cover static MM and the H₂O adapter. SQD MC integration, correlated RDM feedback and polarizable"
" MM are outside this delivery."
msgstr ""
"各求解分支共享活性空间、哈密顿量、框架和芯常数。``e_core`` 已包含 MM 核贡献，底层入口不得再次添加。底层 ``h2`` "
"使用化学家顺序，不再次转置。在嵌入的固定框架中，``hf_energy`` 表示参考行列式期望值，不是弛豫嵌入 SCF 最小值。测试覆盖静态 MM 和 H₂O 适配器。此实现不包含 SQD MC"
" 集成、关联 RDM 反馈或可极化 MM。"

