#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:171
msgid ""
"T0 cannot be disabled to force a downgrade. Only explicit unavailability, budget exhaustion or "
"controlled timeout permits trying a lower tier. The workflow must report numerical failures. "
"Every non-T0 result carries ``baseline_downgrade_reason`` and a warning."
msgstr ""
"不得通过禁用 T0 强制降级。仅在明确不可用、预算耗尽或受控超时时，才允许尝试较低层级。工作流必须报告数值失败。每个非 T0 结果均包含 "
"``baseline_downgrade_reason`` 和警告。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:176
msgid ""
"If uncertainty is unknown, the result records ``None`` and a reason. It must not record zero. T2 "
"reports the T1 diagnostic, convergence, triples correction and triples/correlation ratio. Flags "
"can mark it untrustworthy. Zero T0 uncertainty excludes basis/model/experimental errors."
msgstr ""
"不确定性未知时，结果记录 ``None`` 及原因，不得记录零。T2 报告 T1 诊断、收敛、三重激发校正及三重激发 / 相关能比值。标记可将它判为不可信。T0 "
"不确定性为零不包含基组、模型或实验误差。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:181
msgid ""
"Use ``baseline_energy``, ``baseline_method``, ``baseline_tier``, ``baseline_uncertainty_mHa``, "
"``baseline_downgrade_reason``, ``warnings`` and ``null_reasons``. Output schema ``sqd.result.v1``"
" has 40 fields and writes only canonical ``baseline_*`` keys. An old ``shci_energy`` number alone"
" cannot tell whether it came from CASCI or SHCI. Readers must require explicit method, tier, "
"units and uncertainty semantics. They must reject conflicting aliases."
msgstr ""
"使用 "
"``baseline_energy``、``baseline_method``、``baseline_tier``、``baseline_uncertainty_mHa``、``baseline_downgrade_reason``、``warnings``"
" 和 ``null_reasons``。输出模式 ``sqd.result.v1`` 有 40 个字段，只写入规范的 ``baseline_*`` 键。旧 ``shci_energy`` "
"数值本身无法说明它来自 CASCI 还是 SHCI。读取方必须要求显式方法、层级、单位和不确定性含义，并拒绝冲突别名。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:188
msgid ""
"``delta_mHa = 1000 * (sqd_energy - baseline_energy)`` and ``delta_vs_sci_mHa = 1000 * (sqd_energy"
" - iso_ndet_sci_energy)``: positive means SQD is worse. ``ratio_sqd_over_sci`` is defined only "
"against T0 with a valid nonzero SCI error. SCI and random arms match each spin's subspace "
"dimension. ``subspace_dim`` is their Cartesian product. ``unique_dets_vs_shots`` counts sampled "
"pairs and is a different quantity."
msgstr ""
"``delta_mHa = 1000 * (sqd_energy - baseline_energy)`` 和 ``delta_vs_sci_mHa = 1000 * (sqd_energy -"
" iso_ndet_sci_energy)``：正值表示 SQD 更差。``ratio_sqd_over_sci`` 仅在 T0 及有效非零 SCI 误差下定义。SCI "
"和随机分支匹配每种自旋的子空间维数。``subspace_dim`` 是其笛卡尔积。``unique_dets_vs_shots`` 统计采样对，是另一种量。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:195
msgid ""
"Reference-only outputs have ``None`` and explicit reasons for unexecuted sampling/comparison "
"fields. ``save_json_results`` from ``q2m3.utils.io`` accepts the complete dataclass and preserves"
" these fields. It rejects nonfinite JSON values."
msgstr ""
"仅参考输出对未执行的采样 / 对照字段记录 ``None`` 和明确原因。``q2m3.utils.io`` 中的 ``save_json_results`` "
"接受完整数据类，并保留这些字段。它拒绝非有限 JSON 值。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:201
msgid "Resource limits"
msgstr "资源限制"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:203
msgid ""
"The calibrated Linux model requires serial execution and balanced closed shells. Its domain "
"permits:"
msgstr "校准后的 Linux 模型要求串行执行和平衡闭壳层。适用域允许："

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:206
msgid "2–10 active orbitals."
msgstr "2–10 个活性轨道。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:207
msgid "At most 252 determinants per spin and 63504 determinant pairs."
msgstr "每个自旋最多 252 个行列式，总计最多 63504 个行列式对。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:208
msgid "At most 36 UCJ factors, two batches, two iterations, and 100000 shots."
msgstr "最多 36 个 UCJ 因子、两个批次、两次迭代和 100000 次采样。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:210
msgid ""
"Other stage-specific input/domain checks still apply. Public diagonalization uses two batches, "
"two iterations and ``min(300, shots)`` samples per batch. Unknown/out-of-domain bounds raise "
"``ResourceModelDomainError`` before the allocation. ``allow_large`` cannot bypass the domain, "
"host or hard cap."
msgstr ""
"各阶段的其他输入与适用域检查仍然有效。公开对角化使用两个批次、两次迭代，每批 ``min(300, shots)`` 个样本。未知或域外边界会在分配前抛出 "
"``ResourceModelDomainError``。``allow_large`` 无法绕过适用域、主机上限或硬上限。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:215
msgid ""
"The allocation policy warns at 2048 MB and normally rejects at 8192 MB. Its absolute ceiling is "
"12288 MB. The public executor applies a separate 8192 MB component cap. The effective limit is "
"the smallest component, host, or user cap. A prediction equal to the effective limit rejects "
"before allocation. ``allow_large`` cannot bypass that limit."
msgstr ""
"分配策略在 2048 MB 发出警告，通常在 8192 MB 拒绝。其绝对上限为 12288 MB。公开执行器另设 8192 MB "
"组件上限。有效限制取组件、主机和用户上限的最小值。预测达到有效限制时，程序在分配前拒绝。``allow_large`` 无法绕过该限制。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:222
msgid "All limits use decimal MB. The historical benchmark criterion is ``peak_bytes < 2_000_000_000``."
msgstr "所有限制使用十进制 MB。历史基准判据为 ``peak_bytes < 2_000_000_000``。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/sqd.rst:225
msgid ""
"See :doc:`sqd-validation` for measured results and research status. See :doc:`/api-reference/sqd-"
"results` for all result fields."
msgstr "实测结果和研究状态见 :doc:`sqd-validation`。全部结果字段见 :doc:`/api-reference/sqd-results`。"
